Package: diann.gui
Type: Package
Title: Web GUI for Submitting and Monitoring DIA-NN Jobs on Slurm
        Clusters
Version: 1.9.0
Authors@R: person("Zhang Dong", email = "zhangdong_0121@foxmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny dashboard that puts DIA-NN behind a browser: build commands,
    submit them as Slurm batch jobs running the official DIA-NN container image
    (Apptainer .sif), and monitor queues, logs and results. Supports per-user
    self-hosted runs and command import from pasted DIA-NN command lines.
